-- Angel's Pizza Detailed Punchlist (equipment/furniture/fixtures presence
-- check) — QA-only (requires_audit_type), brand auto-locked to Angel's
-- Pizza via store_restrictions covering all 92 currently active Angel's
-- Pizza stores (NOT Angel's Pizza Express, a separate brand — confirmed
-- via `select brand_name, count(*) from stores join brands...` showing
-- both as distinct brand_name values). Conduct Audit already auto-locks
-- the brand when every restriction shares one brand_id, so whoever fills
-- this out only picks the store.
--
-- No points/weighting in the source document (just a flat equipment list
-- marked Yes/No/NA, unlike the QA Audit Checklists) — equal-weight, same
-- as every checklist that doesn't set pts on its items.
--
-- New stores opened after this migration runs won't automatically appear
-- here — they'd need adding to this template's Store Restrictions via the
-- admin Audit Template editor, same upkeep any store-restricted template
-- already needs.
